        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 striking frost katana</em> is always cool to the touch, nearly uncomfortably so. Unadorned and with no tsuba, its honed blade is carved from a single tusk of dragon-turtle ivory and wrapped in strips of witchwarg hide. Strikes with the katana gain a +2 status bonus to damage rolls against creatures that have a status penalty to their Speed or that are slowed. The status bonus increases to +3 if the weapon has a <em>greater striking</em> rune and +4 for a <em>major striking</em> rune.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Frigid Breeze</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> (air, cold, magical, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You deal cold damage to a creature with a spell or ability</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You point the north wind's night verse at the triggering creature. A gust of wind from nowhere freezes its bones, imparting a –5-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.</p>"
